  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to address key development challenges associated with climate change, energy transition, environmental degradation, and climate-induced health issues in Viet Nam. As the country faces increasing climate-related risks, such as extreme weather events, rising temperatures, and environmental degradation, there is an urgent need to enhance resilience, reduce emissions, and foster sustainable development aligned with the Country Programme Document&#x2019;s 2022-2026 Outcome 2 and signature s</narrative>
